    <item>
      <title>0.3.0</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 07 Aug 2026 20:00:00 +0300</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>Optional menu bar icon with playback controls (Settings &gt; General).</li>
          <li>Mini player can float above other windows.</li>
          <li>Global media keys work when the app is in the background (requires Accessibility permission, off by default).</li>
          <li>Playback position and selected sidebar section are restored on launch.</li>
          <li>Respects Reduce Motion and Increase Contrast system settings; improved VoiceOver labels.</li>
          <li>Fixed: album screen no longer collapses in a narrow detail column.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
