      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>Track list: sortable columns, multi-selection, artist and album shown.</li>
          <li>Search results grouped into Artists, Albums and Tracks, with keyboard navigation.</li>
          <li>Keyboard navigation in the album grid, artists and playlists.</li>
          <li>Fixed: a space could not be typed into the search field.</li>
          <li>Large libraries load and sort off the main thread, so the window no longer freezes.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
